From 3406bf1eb7c5f54dd63e1a2d7e05503cb28a3237 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Harshit Gupta <39994376+arelyx@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 12:59:47 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] freedreno/xenos: 12 + 14 samplers, perspective-correct
 gl_FragCoord.z

- Vertex shader textures took the fetch constants after the fragment
  shader's, and vertex buffers use fetch constants 20-25: with 16 + 16
  advertised, vertex textures overwrote the vertex buffers (piglit
  max-samplers). Fragment textures now take 0-11 and vertex textures 12-19
  and 26-31: 12 + 14 (dEQP's uniform_api cases want up to 14 in the
  vertex shader).
- gl_FragCoord.z was the window z interpolated perspective-correctly; it
  must be linear in screen space. Export z * w and divide by the
  interpolated w in the fragment shader (which is exactly that).

